    LeftParen "("
    Float "0.2"
    Comma ","
    Float "0.0"
    RightParen ")"
  Newline "\n"
  Comment "; Degrees of freedom to prior OMEGA matrix."
  Newline "\n"
  Comment "; Because degrees of freedom is very low, equal to the"
  Newline "\n"
  Comment "; the dimension of the prior OMEGA, this means that the"
  Newline "\n"
  Comment "; prior information to the OMEGAS is highly uninformative"
  Newline "\n"
